---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const title = 'Privacy policy';
const description =
  'What trendingprompt collects, what advertising and hosting partners collect, the cookies involved, and how to opt out or exercise your rights.';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: title,
  description,
  url: `${SITE.url}/privacy`,
  dateModified: '2026-08-11',
};
---
<BaseLayout title={`${title} — trendingprompt`} description={description} schema={schema}>
  <section class="shell page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="page__title">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This policy explains what happens to information about you when you visit
      {' '}{SITE.legalName}. Last reviewed {SITE.policyUpdated}.
    </p>

    <div class="page__body prose">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        This site has no accounts, no login, no newsletter and no contact form. It does not ask you
        for your name, email address or any other personal detail, and it has no database in which
        to store one. What data exists is created automatically by the companies that host the site
        and — once advertising is enabled — serve its ads.
      </p>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.legalName} is an independently run website. For any question about this policy or
        about data associated with your visit, contact
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by Cloudflare Pages. Like every web host, Cloudflare processes technical
        information needed to deliver a page and to protect the service from abuse. That typically
        includes your IP address, the page requested, the time of the request, your browser's user
        agent string, and the referring page. This information is used for delivery, security and
        aggregate traffic measurement. It is not used to build a profile of you and is not sold.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        The site itself sets no cookies for analytics, personalisation or tracking, and stores
        nothing in your browser that identifies you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Third parties may set cookies of their own, in two circumstances:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Security and delivery.</strong> Cloudflare may set a cookie to distinguish
          legitimate visitors from automated traffic.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Advertising.</strong> When advertising is enabled on this site, the ad network
          and its partners may set cookies or read device identifiers to select and measure ads.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings at any time. The site remains fully
        usable with cookies disabled — nothing on it depends on them.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site is funded by advertising served through Google AdSense and, potentially, other
        networks.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on this site.
        </li>
        <li>
          Google's use of advertising cookies — including the DoubleClick DART cookie — enables it
          and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and other sites on
          the internet.
        </li>
        <li>
          You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
          <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.
          You can opt out of a wider set of vendors at
          <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>
          and
          <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Your Online Choices</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Third-party ad networks operating on this site have their own privacy policies governing
          the data they collect. Their practices are not controlled by this site.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Opting out of personalised ads does not remove advertising; it makes the ads you see less
        specific to you.
      </p>

      <h2>If you are in the EEA, UK or Switzerland</h2>
      <p>
        Where advertising or measurement requires consent, you will be shown a consent message
        before those cookies are set, and you can change or withdraw your choice at any time through
        that message. The lawful bases relied on are consent, for advertising and any non-essential
        cookies, and legitimate interest, for the security and delivery logging described above.
      </p>
      <p>
        You have the right to access, correct, erase, restrict or object to the processing of your
        personal data, and the right to lodge a complaint with your national supervisory authority.
        Because this site holds no records that identify you, requests about advertising data are
        usually best directed to the advertising vendor; email the address above and you will be
        pointed to the right place.
      </p>

      <h2>If you are in California</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not sell or share personal information for money. Personalised advertising
        may qualify as "sharing" for cross-context behavioural advertising under the CCPA/CPRA. You
        can opt out through the ad-settings links above, and via any "Do Not Sell or Share My
        Personal Information" control displayed on this site. Requests to know, delete or correct
        can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is aimed at a general adult audience and is not directed at children under 13. It
        does not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has
        provided personal information, contact the address above and it will be removed.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>
        Guides on this site link to AI tools, documentation and other external pages. Once you
        follow a link, you are on someone else's site under someone else's policy. This policy
        covers only {SITE.legalName}.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Because no personal data is collected directly, there is nothing held here to retain. Server
        and security logs are retained by the hosting provider under its own retention schedule.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        This policy will change when the site changes — most likely when advertising or analytics is
        added or replaced. The review date at the top is updated whenever that happens, and material
        changes will be noted on this page rather than made silently.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
